<UserControl x:Class="NINA.Plugins.PolarAlignment.OAPA.OAPAControlPanel"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             xmlns:s="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib"
             xmlns:local="clr-namespace:NINA.Plugins.PolarAlignment.OAPA"
             mc:Ignorable="d">

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <BooleanToVisibilityConverter x:Key="BooleanToVisibilityConverter" />
        <s:String x:Key="OAPASpeedToolTip">Speed of this axis for the moves made from this panel. The controller's own alignment and calibration moves use the speed set on its page.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAGearRatioToolTip">Scale factor used when converting between OAPA motor units and the axis units shown by TPPA.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPARunCurrentToolTip">Run-current value, in milliamps, sent to the OAPA controller for this axis.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAHoldPercentToolTip">Hold-current percentage sent to the OAPA controller for this axis.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAMicrostepsToolTip">Driver microstepping for this axis. Lower values move faster and give more torque at the cost of resolution, and polar alignment has resolution to spare - a platform at 1000 steps per arcminute is far past what a plate solve can measure. Steps per arcminute scale exactly with this setting, so the calibration factor is rescaled with it.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAXBacklashToolTip">Azimuth-axis mechanical backlash in arcminutes, entering the positive direction. Sent to the controller, which compensates it in the moves of its own alignment.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPABacklashModeToolTip">How this axis handles its own play. Full compensates the whole measured backlash on every reversal; Soft compensates it gradually; Unidirectional always approaches from the engaged side; Off leaves the play alone. The controller applies it to the moves of its own alignment.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPABacklashNegativeToolTip">Backlash entering the negative direction, in arcminutes. On an axis loaded by gravity the two directions rarely cost the same. Left equal to the positive value unless set.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAYBacklashToolTip">Altitude-axis mechanical backlash in arcminutes, entering the positive direction. Sent to the controller, which compensates it in the moves of its own alignment.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAConnectionToolTip">How Connect reaches the OAPA controller: USB scans the COM ports, WiFi connects to the address below (firmware 1.3.0 or later).</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAWifiAddressToolTip">The controller's address on your network, e.g. 192.168.1.50, or host:port. The port defaults to 2323. Your router's device list shows it, and so does the controller's event log ("joined ... as ...").</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAControllerAlignsToolTip">The OAPA controller runs the alignment: every error TPPA measures is sent to it, and it decides every move - axis, size, backlash, settling, when to stop. TPPA never moves an OAPA axis itself: it measures, and still finishes by itself below its alignment tolerance. Off, TPPA only measures and nothing moves by itself. Needs controller firmware 1.3.0 or later.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAMoveCapToolTip">The largest single correction the controller makes, 1 to 120 arcminutes. Larger closes a large error in fewer corrections; each is still at most 80% of the error TPPA measures. Sent to the controller on connection and whenever it changes; it applies from the next alignment the controller starts.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPACalibrateOnControllerToolTip">The controller measures the steps per arcminute and the backlash of both axes, and the values found are kept in these settings. While TPPA is measuring it uses TPPA's readings and aligns afterwards; otherwise this panel captures and plate-solves frames itself and nothing is aligned afterwards. Without calibrated or known factors the controller also calibrates by itself when TPPA starts.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAFactorModeToolTip">Where this axis' factor comes from. Steps/arcmin: the calibration's value, or one typed in. Gear ratio: computed from the known reduction, the motor's steps per revolution and the driver's microsteps. A calibration switches the axis back to Steps/arcmin with the measured value.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAMechanicalRatioToolTip">Motor turns per axis turn, e.g. 100 for a 100:1 worm. Only exact for gears; an axis driven by a screw does not turn at a constant ratio along its travel, so there the calibration is more precise.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAMotorStepsToolTip">Full steps per motor revolution: 200 for a 1.8 degree motor, 400 for a 0.9 degree one.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAJogUpToolTip">Altitude up by the step (the positive direction). If it goes the wrong way, use one of the two, not both: "Motor direction" on the controller&apos;s page turns the motor around for everyone (N.I.N.A., the page, the alignment); "Reverse altitude" in the options flips N.I.N.A.&apos;s moves only.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAJogDownToolTip">Altitude down by the step.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAJogLeftToolTip">Azimuth by the step in the negative direction. If it goes the wrong way, use one of the two, not both: "Motor direction" on the controller&apos;s page turns the motor around for everyone (N.I.N.A., the page, the alignment); "Reverse azimuth" in the options flips N.I.N.A.&apos;s moves only.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAJogRightToolTip">Azimuth by the step in the positive direction.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAStopToolTip">Immediately decelerate both axes to a stop, wherever they are - also while the controller is aligning or calibrating, which it then ends. A stop that does not reach the controller is reported.</s:String>
        <s:String x:Key="OAPAJogStepToolTip">How far one press of an arrow moves the axis, in arcminutes.</s:String>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <StackPanel>
        <!-- Connection -->
        <GroupBox Header="Connection">
            <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAConnectionToolTip}">Link</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" MinWidth="70" ItemsSource="{Binding ConnectionModes}" SelectedItem="{Binding ConnectionMode}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAConnectionToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAWifiAddressToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding IsWifiConnection, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">Address</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" MinWidth="140" Text="{Binding WifiAddress, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAWifiAddressToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding IsWifiConnection, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}" />
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAControllerAlignsToolTip}">Controller aligns</TextBlock>
                    <CheckBox Margin="5" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsChecked="{Binding ControllerAligns}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAControllerAlignsToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMoveCapToolTip}">Move cap (')</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" MinWidth="45" Text="{Binding MoveCap, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMoveCapToolTip}" />
                    <Button Margin="5" Padding="8,2" Command="{Binding CalibrateOnControllerCommand}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPACalibrateOnControllerToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding Connected, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">Calibrate</Button>
                </StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Margin="5,0,5,5" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="{Binding ControllerAlignsMeaning}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAControllerAlignsToolTip}" />
                <TextBlock Margin="5,0,5,5" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="{Binding ControllerStatus}" Visibility="{Binding Connected, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}" />
            </StackPanel>
        </GroupBox>

        <!-- Motor Settings -->
        <Grid>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition />
                <ColumnDefinition />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <!-- Azimuth Settings -->
            <GroupBox Header="Azimuth Motor Settings">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPASpeedToolTip}">Speed (steps/s)</TextBlock>
                    <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1">
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,5,0" Opacity="0.6" FontSize="10" Text="{Binding XSpeedPhysical}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPASpeedToolTip}" />
                    <ComboBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" SelectedValue="{Binding XSpeed}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPASpeedToolTip}">
                        <ComboBox.ItemsSource>
                            <x:Array Type="{x:Type s:Int32}">
                                <s:Int32>100</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>200</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>300</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>400</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>500</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>600</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>700</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>800</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>900</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1000</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1250</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1500</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1750</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>2000</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>2500</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>3000</s:Int32>
                            </x:Array>
                        </ComboBox.ItemsSource>
                    </ComboBox>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAGearRatioToolTip}">Calibration Factor</TextBlock>
                    <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="3">
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,5,0" Opacity="0.6" FontSize="10" Text="{Binding XGearRatioSourceLabel}" />
                        <TextBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XGearRatio}" IsEnabled="{Binding XFactorEditable}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAGearRatioToolTip}" />
                    </DockPanel>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPARunCurrentToolTip}">Run (mA)</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XRunCurrent}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPARunCurrentToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAHoldPercentToolTip}">Hold %</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XHoldPercent}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAHoldPercentToolTip}" />

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAXBacklashToolTip}">Backlash + (')</TextBlock>
                    <DockPanel Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1">
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,5,0" Opacity="0.6" FontSize="10" Text="{Binding XBacklashSourceLabel}" />
                        <TextBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XBacklashCompensation}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAXBacklashToolTip}" />
                    </DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashModeToolTip}">Backlash mode</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ItemsSource="{Binding BacklashModeNames}" SelectedItem="{Binding XBacklashModeName}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashModeToolTip}" />

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashNegativeToolTip}">Backlash - (')</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XBacklashCompensationNegative}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashNegativeToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMicrostepsToolTip}">Microsteps</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ItemsSource="{Binding MicrostepOptions}" SelectedValue="{Binding XMicrosteps}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMicrostepsToolTip}" />

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAFactorModeToolTip}">Factor from</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ItemsSource="{Binding FactorModes}" SelectedItem="{Binding XFactorMode}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAFactorModeToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMechanicalRatioToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding XIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">Gear ratio (N:1)</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XMechanicalRatio}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMechanicalRatioToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding XIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMotorStepsToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding XIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">Motor steps/rev</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding XMotorStepsPerRev}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMotorStepsToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding XIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}" />
                </Grid>
            </GroupBox>

            <!-- Altitude Settings -->
            <GroupBox Grid.Column="1" Header="Altitude Motor Settings">
                <Grid>
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPASpeedToolTip}">Speed (steps/s)</TextBlock>
                    <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1">
                    <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,5,0" Opacity="0.6" FontSize="10" Text="{Binding YSpeedPhysical}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPASpeedToolTip}" />
                    <ComboBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" SelectedValue="{Binding YSpeed}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPASpeedToolTip}">
                        <ComboBox.ItemsSource>
                            <x:Array Type="{x:Type s:Int32}">
                                <s:Int32>100</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>200</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>300</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>400</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>500</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>600</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>700</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>800</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>900</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1000</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1250</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1500</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>1750</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>2000</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>2500</s:Int32>
                                <s:Int32>3000</s:Int32>
                            </x:Array>
                        </ComboBox.ItemsSource>
                    </ComboBox>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAGearRatioToolTip}">Calibration Factor</TextBlock>
                    <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="3">
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,5,0" Opacity="0.6" FontSize="10" Text="{Binding YGearRatioSourceLabel}" />
                        <TextBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YGearRatio}" IsEnabled="{Binding YFactorEditable}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAGearRatioToolTip}" />
                    </DockPanel>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPARunCurrentToolTip}">Run (mA)</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YRunCurrent}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPARunCurrentToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAHoldPercentToolTip}">Hold %</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YHoldPercent}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAHoldPercentToolTip}" />

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAYBacklashToolTip}">Backlash + (')</TextBlock>
                    <DockPanel Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1">
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,5,0" Opacity="0.6" FontSize="10" Text="{Binding YBacklashSourceLabel}" />
                        <TextBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YBacklashCompensation}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAYBacklashToolTip}" />
                    </DockPanel>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashModeToolTip}">Backlash mode</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ItemsSource="{Binding BacklashModeNames}" SelectedItem="{Binding YBacklashModeName}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashModeToolTip}" />

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashNegativeToolTip}">Backlash - (')</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YBacklashCompensationNegative}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPABacklashNegativeToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMicrostepsToolTip}">Microsteps</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ItemsSource="{Binding MicrostepOptions}" SelectedValue="{Binding YMicrosteps}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMicrostepsToolTip}" />

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAFactorModeToolTip}">Factor from</TextBlock>
                    <ComboBox Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ItemsSource="{Binding FactorModes}" SelectedItem="{Binding YFactorMode}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAFactorModeToolTip}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMechanicalRatioToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding YIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">Gear ratio (N:1)</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YMechanicalRatio}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMechanicalRatioToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding YIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMotorStepsToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding YIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">Motor steps/rev</TextBlock>
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" Text="{Binding YMotorStepsPerRev}" IsEnabled="{Binding IsNotMoving}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAMotorStepsToolTip}" Visibility="{Binding YIsGearMode, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}" />
                </Grid>
            </GroupBox>
        </Grid>

        <!-- Manual Control Panel - Only Visible When Connected And Manual -->
        <Grid Margin="0,5,0,0">
            <Grid.Style>
                <Style TargetType="Grid">
                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                    <Style.Triggers>
                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Connected}" Value="False">
                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                        </DataTrigger>
                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding DoAutomatedAdjustments}" Value="True">
                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                        </DataTrigger>
                    </Style.Triggers>
                </Style>
            </Grid.Style>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition />
                <ColumnDefinition />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <!-- Arrows: up/down move the altitude, left/right the azimuth, STOP halts a move -->
            <GroupBox Header="Manual move">
                <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center">
                    <Grid HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,5,0,5">
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <Button Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Width="60" Height="45" Margin="3" Command="{Binding JogCommand}" CommandParameter="up" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAJogUpToolTip}">
                            <StackPanel><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="18" Text="&#x25B2;" /><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Text="ALT +" /></StackPanel>
                        </Button>
                        <Button Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Width="60" Height="45" Margin="3" Command="{Binding JogCommand}" CommandParameter="left" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAJogLeftToolTip}">
                            <StackPanel><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="18" Text="&#x25C0;" /><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Text="AZ -" /></StackPanel>
                        </Button>
                        <Button Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Width="60" Height="45" Margin="3" Command="{Binding StopMotionCommand}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAStopToolTip}">
                            <StackPanel><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="18" Text="&#x25A0;" /><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Text="STOP" /></StackPanel>
                        </Button>
                        <Button Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="2" Width="60" Height="45" Margin="3" Command="{Binding JogCommand}" CommandParameter="right" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAJogRightToolTip}">
                            <StackPanel><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="18" Text="&#x25B6;" /><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Text="AZ +" /></StackPanel>
                        </Button>
                        <Button Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Width="60" Height="45" Margin="3" Command="{Binding JogCommand}" CommandParameter="down" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAJogDownToolTip}">
                            <StackPanel><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="18" Text="&#x25BC;" /><TextBlock HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="10" Text="ALT -" /></StackPanel>
                        </Button>
                    </Grid>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAJogStepToolTip}">Step (')</TextBlock>
                        <ComboBox VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5" MinWidth="60" ItemsSource="{Binding JogSteps}" SelectedItem="{Binding JogStep}" ToolTip="{StaticResource OAPAJogStepToolTip}" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </GroupBox>

            <!-- Where the axes are, and a move to an exact position -->
            <GroupBox Grid.Column="1" Header="Position">
                <Grid Margin="0,5,0,0">
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <ColumnDefinition />
                        <ColumnDefinition />
                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="11" Opacity="0.7" Text="AZ (X)" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="11" Opacity="0.7" Text="ALT (Y)" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="24" Text="{Binding PositionX, StringFormat=N2}" />
                    <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" HorizontalAlignment="Center" FontSize="24" Text="{Binding PositionY, StringFormat=N2}" />

                    <TextBox Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="0" Margin="5,5,5,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalContentAlignment="Right" Text="{Binding TargetPositionX}" />
                    <TextBox Grid.Row="2" Grid.Column="1" Margin="5,5,5,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalContentAlignment="Right" Text="{Binding TargetPositionY}" />
                    <Button Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" Height="25" Margin="5" Command="{Binding MoveXCommand}">Move AZ</Button>
                    <Button Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="1" Height="25" Margin="5" Command="{Binding MoveYCommand}">Move ALT</Button>
                </Grid>
            </GroupBox>
        </Grid>

        <!-- Home Position - Only Visible When Connected -->
        <GroupBox Header="Home Position"
                  Margin="0,5,0,0"
                  Visibility="{Binding Connected, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">
            <Grid>
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition />
                    <ColumnDefinition />
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Button Grid.Column="0" Height="25" Margin="5" Command="{Binding GoHomeCommand}"
                        ToolTip="Move both axes back to the home position stored in this session">Go Home</Button>
                <Button Grid.Column="1" Height="25" Margin="5" Command="{Binding SetHomeCommand}"
                        ToolTip="Store the current axis positions as the home position for this session. The controller's position counter restarts at 0 on power-up, so the stored home is discarded on reconnect.">Set Home</Button>
                <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Margin="5" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                            Visibility="{Binding HasHome, Converter={StaticResource BooleanToVisibilityConverter}}">
                    <TextBlock Text="X: " />
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding HomeX, StringFormat=N2}" />
                    <TextBlock Text="  Y: " />
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding HomeY, StringFormat=N2}" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
        </GroupBox>

    </StackPanel>
</UserControl>
